      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Mute the blue group (Ctrl+M).\n2. Change the seed on 'Multiscale Seeded Noise' until the draft preview looks right (seconds per try).\n3. Un-mute the group and queue: the draft is cached, only the 4K render runs.\n\nRules:\n- final size = draft size × factor, exactly\n- deterministic sampler (euler), denoise 1.0\n- the guide's reference is the draft upscaled in PIXEL space and re-encoded\n\nModel loaders are set up for Qwen-Image 2.1 — swap in your own."
      ],
      "title": "How to use"
    }
